# Mob programs from the fixture area (tools/fixtures/files/mobprog.are, put in place with @place), with only
# area_update running. The herald (30000) and the doorman (30001) stand in the temple (3001).
# - greet: Decimus (10) walks in and is welcomed and announced; Heroic (51) is a hero; Smokegod (60) is bowed to
# - grall: the doorman nods to everyone who comes in
# - speech "check": every if-check, on Decimus and the herald, with or and and, nested ifs, and a break
# - speech "codes": every $-code; $R gives Decimus's name, not the random player's (#87), and a bad code gives
#   <@@@>
# - act "smiles": Decimus smiles, and the herald smiles back
# - give "all": Decimus's banner, a light, with its values, vnum and name checked; bribe "10": ten silver or more
# - give 3001: a bottle of beer, by vnum, to the doorman
# - exit north: the doorman stops Decimus; exall east: and east too, though there's no way east
# - codes again with Heroic and Smokegod there: $r picks one at random each time, and $R still says Decimus
@place mobprog.are mobprog.are
@place area-mobprog.lst area.lst
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
holylight
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
@return
@as god
@mob 30000 3001
@mob 30001 3001
set char decimus silver 100
@as dec
south
north
say check
say codes
smile
remove banner
give banner herald
give 5 silver herald
give 10 silver herald
@obj 3001 3001
get bottle
give bottle doorman
north
east
@connect hero
Heroic
psswrd
@return
@return
south
north
@as god
south
north
@as dec
say codes
say codes
say codes
@state
